{"skill":{"slug":"microsoft-excel","displayName":"microsoft-excel"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790939012256,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":53708,"sha256":"fb52d65858c98e098be99521721f0591fb8e179fc61f1c81b93b48d10f852574","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2559,"sha256":"71ebda67705ab681d9a993eeceef0b5ac48b96dfdd0711746f3a56d7438f610e","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790939509558,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b5eac0e909d7abca1eb6da46148c2dbd828850533a5e435ef9ecbb7ec3b64a0e","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b5eac0e909d7abca1eb6da46148c2dbd828850533a5e435ef9ecbb7ec3b64a0e","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790939210585},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":13,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1790939509558},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a disclosed Microsoft Excel integration that uses Maton OAuth and CLI access, with clear warnings around writes, credentials, and automation.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, Bash, and an OAuth-backed Maton account are proportionate for API integration, and the instructions default to read/list calls with confirmation before writes or new connections.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation is through pinned Maton CLI package instructions or Homebrew with pinning; the artifact contains Markdown documentation and no executable scripts.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package includes shared trigger catalogues for non-Excel sources such as Linear, but the artifact repeatedly states they do not expand Excel capability and should be used only when the user names that connected source.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"OAuth tokens are stored in the OS credential store, and functions, triggers, and destinations can persist, but these behaviors are disclosed with explicit approval, scoping, and deletion guidance; no hidden persistence was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill's main capability is reading and writing Excel workbooks through Microsoft Graph via Maton-managed OAuth, which matches its stated purpose; hosted functions and triggers are documented as optional automation around approved Excel actions.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install this only if you want Maton to access Excel data in your Microsoft account. Before using it, confirm the account and scopes, approve every write or automation separately, keep trigger scopes narrow, and only use the non-Excel trigger references when you intentionally want cross-app automation with a named source and destination.","findings":"[SDI-2] expected: The Linear trigger reference is actionable, but it is presented as shared Maton platform event-source documentation and is bounded by instructions to use it only when the user has connected Linear and asked for Linear events by name.\n[SDI-4] expected: The scope disclaimer is backed by repeated operational limits in the skill: Excel is not an event source, non-Excel triggers do not widen Excel access, third-party destinations require explicit approval, and payload minimization is emphasized.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790939509558}}}}}